    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Appropriations",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S3112\n\nTITLE  OF  BILL:   An act making an appropriation to pay Debra E. Conte,\nwidow of the late James D.  Conte, member of the Assembly from the  10th\nassembly district, the balance due of his unpaid annual compensation for\na portion of the year 2012\n\nSUMMARY  OF  PROVISIONS:  Section  1.  The  sum of nineteen thousand two\nhundred thirty dollars and  eighty-five  cents  ($19,230.85)  is  hereby\nappropriated out of any moneys in the general fund of the state treasury\nto  the credit of the state purposes account not otherwise appropriated,\nfor payment to Debra E. Conte, the widow of the  late  James  D.  Conte,\nmember  of the assembly from the 10th assembly district, who died on the\n16th day of October 2012, for the  balance  due  of  the  unpaid  annual\ncompensation  which  would  have  been earned by him had he continued to\nlive and serve as such member until the 3151 day of December, 2012.  The\namount  hereby  appropriated  shall  be payable to Debra E. Conte on the\naudit and warrant of the comptroller on a voucher certified or  approved\nin the manner prescribed by law.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:  Payment  of the remaining annual compensation has tradi-\ntionally been paid to the widower of a member  of  the  legislature  who\ndies in service.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY: None.\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS: $19,230.85\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE: This act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
